# anchors — the durable per-turn advance moved from ~:834 to :1043, and the UXD-08 `:hooks`
# persistence landed between `chain:` and `transcript:` in create_run!, so the second hunk
# now anchors on the `hooks:` line instead of on `chain:`. Removed/added lines, the
# never-nil watchdog it drops, and all three MUST_FAIL targets are unchanged.)
